.*
.* The media displays: WRKIMGCLG (the catalogs, F11 their texts),
.* WRKIMGCLGE (one catalog's entries), WRKTAPCTG (a media library's
.* cartridges) and WRKMLBSTS (the libraries and their drives). The
.* WRKIMGCLG geometry follows golden/phase11/displays/wrkimgclg.txt.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TYPECL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ASPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=DSTSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 12'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=DIRCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=IDXCL BASETYPE='CHAR 5'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=YNCL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VOLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 18'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FILECL BASETYPE='CHAR 22'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CTGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 9'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CVOLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LOCCL BASETYPE='CHAR 14'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=RSRCCL BASETYPE='CHAR 16'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ALLOCCL BASETYPE='CHAR 13'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=CLG CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CLGSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=CLGTYPE CLASS=TYPECL.
:VAR NAME=CLGASP CLASS=ASPCL.
:VAR NAME=CLGDEV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEVSTS CLASS=DSTSCL.
:VAR NAME=CLGTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=CLGDIR CLASS=DIRCL.
:VAR NAME=IDX CLASS=IDXCL.
:VAR NAME=ENTSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=WRTPTC CLASS=YNCL.
:VAR NAME=VOLNAM CLASS=VOLCL.
:VAR NAME=IMGFILE CLASS=FILECL.
:VAR NAME=MLBDEV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CTG CLASS=CTGCL.
:VAR NAME=CTGVOL CLASS=CVOLCL.
:VAR NAME=CTGCGY CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CTGSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=CTGLOC CLASS=LOCCL.
:VAR NAME=RSRC CLASS=RSRCCL.
:VAR NAME=RSRCSTS CLASS=DSTSCL.
:VAR NAME=ALLOC CLASS=ALLOCCL.
:VAR NAME=RSRCCTG CLASS=CTGCL.
:VAR NAME=RSRCLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CLGVIEW CLASS=TYPECL VALUE='STATUS'.
:COND NAME=STSVIEW EXPR='&CLGVIEW. EQ "STATUS"'.
:COND NAME=TXTVIEW EXPR='&CLGVIEW. NE "STATUS"'.
:LISTDEF NAME=CLGS VARS='OPT CLG CLGSTS CLGTYPE CLGASP CLGDEV DEVSTS CLGTEXT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=ENTS VARS='OPT IDX ENTSTS WRTPTC VOLNAM IMGFILE'.
:LISTDEF NAME=CTGS VARS='OPT CTG CTGVOL CTGCGY CTGSTS CTGLOC'.
:LISTDEF NAME=RSRCS VARS='OPT RSRC RSRCSTS ALLOC RSRCCTG RSRCLIB'.
:KEYL NAME=CLGKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=STSVIEW.F11=View descriptions
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=TXTVIEW.F11=View status and devices
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=ENTKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='CMD ?ADDIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.)'.F6=Add entry
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=CTGKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=MLBKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKIMGCLG KEYL=CLGKEYS HELP=WRKIMGCLG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with Image Catalogs
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CLGS.(No image catalogs)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?CRTIMGCLG'.1=Create
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 2'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD ?LODIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.) OPTION(*LOAD)'.8=Load
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='CMD LODIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.) OPTION(*UNLOAD)'.9=Unload
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ENTER='CMD ?VFYIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.)'.10=Verify
:LISTACT OPTION=12 ENTER='RETURN 12'.12=Work with entries
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=CLG USAGE=OUTPUT.Image Catalog
:LISTCOL VAR=CLGSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=CLGTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=CLGASP USAGE=OUTPUT.ASP Threshold
:LISTCOL VAR=CLGDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Device Status
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKIMGCLG2 KEYL=CLGKEYS HELP=WRKIMGCLG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with Image Catalogs
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CLGS.(No image catalogs)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?CRTIMGCLG'.1=Create
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 2'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD ?LODIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.) OPTION(*LOAD)'.8=Load
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='CMD LODIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.) OPTION(*UNLOAD)'.9=Unload
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ENTER='CMD ?VFYIMGCLG IMGCLG(&CLG.)'.10=Verify
:LISTACT OPTION=12 ENTER='RETURN 12'.12=Work with entries
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=CLG USAGE=OUTPUT.Image Catalog
:LISTCOL VAR=CLGTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKIMGCLGE KEYL=ENTKEYS HELP=WRKIMGCLGE ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Image Catalog Entries
:DATA DEPTH=5.
:DATAI VAR=CLG USAGE=OUTPUT.Image catalog
:DATAI VAR=CLGSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:DATAI VAR=CLGTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:DATAI VAR=CLGDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:DATAI VAR=CLGDIR USAGE=OUTPUT.Directory
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=ENTS.(No entries)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.) IMGCLGIDX(&IDX.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD RMVIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.) IMGCLGIDX(&IDX.)'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD LODIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.) IMGCLGIDX(&IDX.) OPTION(*LOAD)'.6=Load
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD LODIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.) IMGCLGIDX(&IDX.) OPTION(*MOUNT)'.8=Mount
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='CMD LODIMGCLGE IMGCLG(&CLG.) IMGCLGIDX(&IDX.) OPTION(*UNLOAD)'.9=Unload
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=IDX USAGE=OUTPUT.Index
:LISTCOL VAR=ENTSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=WRTPTC USAGE=OUTPUT.Write Protect
:LISTCOL VAR=VOLNAM USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume
:LISTCOL VAR=IMGFILE USAGE=OUTPUT.Image File
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKTAPCTG KEYL=CTGKEYS HELP=WRKTAPCTG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Tape Cartridges
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAI VAR=MLBDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Library device
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CTGS.(No cartridges)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?ADDTAPCTG DEV(&MLBDEV.) CTG(&CTG.)'.1=Add
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGTAPCTG DEV(&MLBDEV.) CTG(&CTG.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD RMVTAPCTG DEV(&MLBDEV.) CTG(&CTG.)'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPTAPCTG DEV(&MLBDEV.) CTG(&CTG.)'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 6'.6=Mount
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 8'.8=Demount
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=CTG USAGE=OUTPUT.Cartridge ID
:LISTCOL VAR=CTGVOL USAGE=OUTPUT.Volume ID
:LISTCOL VAR=CTGCGY USAGE=OUTPUT.Category
:LISTCOL VAR=CTGSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=CTGLOC USAGE=OUTPUT.Location
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKMLBSTS KEYL=MLBKEYS HELP=WRKMLBSTS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Media Library Status
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSRCS.(No media libraries)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD VRYCFG CFGOBJ(&RSRCLIB.) CFGTYPE(*DEV) STATUS(*ON)'.1=Vary on
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD VRYCFG CFGOBJ(&RSRCLIB.) CFGTYPE(*DEV) STATUS(*OFF)'.2=Vary off
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 4'.4=Allocate resource
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Allocate unprotected
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 6'.6=Deallocate resource
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKTAPCTG DEV(&RSRCLIB.)'.8=Work with cartridges
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSRC USAGE=OUTPUT.Device/Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSRCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=ALLOC USAGE=OUTPUT.Allocation
:LISTCOL VAR=RSRCCTG USAGE=OUTPUT.Cartridge
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKIMGCLG.Work with Image Catalogs - Help
:P.Each image catalog is a directory of virtual optical images or virtual
tape volumes. Load one on a virtual device to use its volumes; F11
switches between the status columns and the catalogs' texts.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKIMGCLGE.Work with Image Catalog Entries - Help
:P.The volumes of one catalog. A loaded entry is in the device; the
mounted one is the volume the device presents. F6 adds an entry.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKTAPCTG.Work with Tape Cartridges - Help
:P.The cartridges a media library holds. New ones arrive in *INSERT;
add them to a category before use. Mount moves a cartridge into a drive,
demount sends it back to its slot, remove ejects it to a station.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKMLBSTS.Work with Media Library Status - Help
:P.Each media library and its drives. An allocated drive is held by this
system, an unprotected one is used when needed, a deallocated one never.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
